GenProg: Signal Synthesis via Genetic Programming (Archived Research Code)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This repository contains archived MATLAB code from early research exploring genetic-programming\'96based signal synthesis and matching.\uc0\u8232 The methods implemented here were developed as part of a research line that later contributed to a peer-reviewed 
\f0\b IEEE Transactions
\f1\b0  publication in healthcare time-series analysis.\
This code is shared 
\f0\b for transparency and methodological reference
\f1\b0 . It is not actively maintained and is not intended as a production-ready library.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa319\partightenfactor0

